W1700K: apply non-MLO AP power at hostapd BSS lifecycle boundaries

Scope is indexed radios containing only non-MLO APs. Preserve upstream MLO
and other-mode behavior; this is not a per-link API. bss_add runs after
beacon setup (including delayed ACS/CAC); no iface ENABLED gate is needed.
Power changes use hostapd's existing restart/cancellation path. Failures are
logged and notified, not reported as successful power application; these
void callbacks cannot propagate a synchronous error to netifd config_set.

